<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss retail sales fall 0.7 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Swiss retail sales fall 0.7 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail sales in Switzerland, measured by value, fell year-on-year 0.7 percent in January after a 1.8 percent drop in December and a 0.1 percent January 1996 rise, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>Adjusted for inflation, the office said real retail turnover in January was 1.5 percent lower than last year, with sales of foods down 0.5 percent and clothes and textiles down by 0.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
